# Deliberately *committed* although generated:
#   art/**/*.svg                   the game's drawings (art/README.md)
#   src/**/*.module.d.css.ts       typed CSS module class names
#   tests/engine/reference/        frozen checksums and samples
#   package-lock.json              reproducible installs
# All are written by a script and still versioned: without them the game does
# not run, the types do not check, or the test suite loses its reference point.
